Phaemos Arduino Nano Secondary Node - Proteus ISIS Schematic Placeholder

This file is a placeholder. The actual Proteus schematic (.pdsprj)
will be created in Phase 2/3 using Proteus ISIS.

Components to place in Phase 2:
- Arduino Nano
- BME280 breakout (I2C, A4=SDA, A5=SCL)
- LDR + 10k voltage divider (A0)
- FC-28 moisture sensor (A1)
- TX/RX to ESP32 via level shifter (5V->3.3V)
